      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "**File: Add** gives SeedVR the clip as `video_url`. SeedVR enlarges it to 1080p. **Request Options** sends this request at low priority: when other requests of yours wait for the same model on fal, they go first. It changes nothing else.\n\nIf you cancel while the request still waits in fal's queue, fal drops it and bills nothing. A request fal has already started may still finish and be billed. Collect it with **video-05-recover-a-video**."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
